\(M\), which is usually set to 33 in practice. Given the value of \(M\), the indexing RGB colors \(\{r^{I}_{(i,j,k)},g^{I}_{(i,j,k)},b^{I}_{(i,j,k)}\}_{i,j,k=0,...,M-1}\) are obtained by uniformly discretizing the RGB color.
